  "description": "MUBFOH crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C90 H115 Er5 N10 O45 P10. From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er5 (Er) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.582-5.129 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 87.57-158.11°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C90H115Er5N10O45P10.",
